  "abstract": "<jats:p>Silicon Mach\u2013Zehnder modulators (MZMs) are widely used for 100G/200G PAM4, but their scalability to IMDD 400G/lane is uncertain. We demonstrate a silicon MZM with a commercial SiGe driver enabling 400G/lane PAM4 transmission.</jats:p>",
